  body: "# Industrial Retirement Allowance and REA conversion\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe industrial-injuries
    guidance distinguishes Retirement Allowance from REA, with conversion linked to pensionable age, regular employment
    and prior REA conditions, and separate award/payment days.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThis is Industrial
    Injuries Retirement Allowance, not State Pension or Retirement Pension. Historical examples using age 65 do
    not establish current pensionable age. The source’s rate and threshold figures are not applied as a calculation,
    and its post-1 October 1990 restriction on returning to REA remains explicit.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n-
    [DMG 64035, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/664b1c4dbd01f5ed32793e51/dmg-chapter-64-background-to-the-industrial-scheme.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 71777, PDF page 124](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=124).\n\
    - [DMG 71778, PDF page 125](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=125).\n\
    - [DMG 71780, PDF page 125](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=125).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol11-ch64`:
    PDF `6397b92476509f66c98cbd574ef4692bf1888e41fe7da4a9ec227b7a13a62b78`; extracted pages `2bbe57d32fca42027ea6a81e508bda907df0d56da34c4d59ba73862530a659e8`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:33.768652Z`.\n- `dmg-vol11-ch71`: PDF `e001c101fb7be9bc739a8a5b9c1281637a93f34a099658e7dafef6fbb2b5d4f5`;
    extracted pages `1414e514cf78c7a2e0a3ce66e2d88727d3fda28f764fd2e8654361dc569356d6`; acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.428591Z`.\n"
